# SIVRCE Brand Lock (FROZEN 2026-07-17)

Before any UI / CSS / component work: read `app/BRAND.md`. Do not invent colors,
fonts, radii, shadows, logo geometry, or category hues. Owner-approved lock.

## Sources of truth (must stay in sync)

1. `app/BRAND.md` — full spec
2. `app/src/lib/brand.ts` — JS tokens
3. `app/src/lib/category-brand.ts` — category / service / deal hues
4. `app/src/app/globals.css` — `@theme` + dark flips
5. `logo/source/sivrce-lockup-master.png` + `logo/board1x1/` + `app/public/logo/` + `Logo.tsx` — lockup 1:1

