Category / deal / service: `CATEGORY_BRAND` · `SERVICE_BRAND` · `DEAL_BRAND` only.

## Hard bans

- No purple-on-white / cream+terracotta / Inter-default AI looks
- No `bg-black/*` — navy-tint overlays only
- No pure-black shadows — navy-tint only
- No emoji in UI · Lucide only · Manrope + Noto Sans Georgian only
- No new brand hex without updating BRAND.md + brand.ts + globals.css together
- Logo: never recolor / rotate / outline; board PNG lockup in Logo.tsx is locked

## Shape / type / motion quick refs

- Radius: card 26 · tile 22 · module 16 · control 12 · buttons pill
- Type: Manrope 900 headlines, tracking −0.02…−0.045em; body 500–600
- Motion ease `[0.21,0.65,0.2,1]`, reveal y+28 / 0.7s
- Wordmark: lowercase `sivrce` + orange period
